WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:30.296
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:30.566 --> 01:31.551
=Tigers Sniff the Rose=

3
01:31.551 --> 01:33.560
(Based on the novel of the same name by Yiren Kuikui)

4
01:35.260 --> 01:38.940
=Episode 13=

5
01:59.340 --> 01:59.820
Your Highness.

6
02:01.860 --> 02:03.660
Did Yan Shang upset you?

7
02:06.340 --> 02:06.780
No.

8
02:12.620 --> 02:13.820
He didn't upset me.

9
02:16.420 --> 02:17.780
Hearing him say those silly things

10
02:21.460 --> 02:22.580
actually made me quite happy.

11
02:25.500 --> 02:26.380
Then why do you look

12
02:26.380 --> 02:27.220
so unhappy?

13
02:28.060 --> 02:29.140
What exactly did Yan Shang say?

14
02:32.740 --> 02:34.380
Seeing him come back in such a terrible state,

15
02:35.340 --> 02:37.300
I was furious and had nowhere to vent my anger.

16
02:40.620 --> 02:41.580
Enough worrying about me.

17
02:42.180 --> 02:43.180
How are things between you and Liu Wenji?

18
02:49.900 --> 02:51.060
Don't keep dragging things out.

19
02:51.340 --> 02:52.420
Whether you stay together or part ways,

20
02:53.300 --> 02:54.700
you need to make things clear with him.

21
03:04.500 --> 03:05.380
(Grocery Store) Princess Danyang

22
03:06.220 --> 03:07.020
has been most gracious

23
03:08.140 --> 03:09.100
and treated me very well.

24
03:10.020 --> 03:10.660
It's just...

25
03:13.180 --> 03:14.340
I'm afraid I'm not capable enough

26
03:15.220 --> 03:16.780
to win Her Highness's heart.

27
03:18.020 --> 03:19.020
I've disappointed you, Master.

28
03:20.700 --> 03:21.780
Silly boy.

29
03:22.940 --> 03:23.780
If you're having trouble,

30
03:24.300 --> 03:25.540
come to me.

31
03:26.980 --> 03:29.380
I called you here today to tell you

32
03:30.300 --> 03:32.100
that as for the man the Princess favors,

33
03:33.300 --> 03:34.420
I've taken care of him for you.

34
03:35.780 --> 03:37.700
After Grand Princess Luling has had her way with him,

35
03:37.940 --> 03:39.340
Princess Danyang surely won't want him anymore.

36
03:41.340 --> 03:42.380
Now,

37
03:42.900 --> 03:44.580
it's up to you

38
03:45.460 --> 03:46.860
to win her over.

39
03:58.900 --> 03:59.420
Yan Shang.

40
04:00.420 --> 04:00.700
I...

41
04:02.620 --> 04:03.460
I've made a terrible mistake

42
04:03.780 --> 04:04.420
and caused you great harm.

43
04:05.140 --> 04:05.860
I beg your forgiveness.

44
04:09.780 --> 04:10.740
What are you doing?

45
04:11.700 --> 04:13.100
Bowing like that to someone lying in bed

46
04:13.500 --> 04:14.260
is terribly unlucky.

47
04:15.100 --> 04:15.460
Get up.

48
04:17.380 --> 04:18.060
Forgive me.

49
04:18.580 --> 04:19.420
I wasn't thinking straight.

50
04:20.460 --> 04:21.060
Take your time.

51
04:21.660 --> 04:22.420
What exactly happened?

52
04:25.540 --> 04:27.060
The humiliation you've suffered

53
04:27.860 --> 04:28.620
may have

54
04:29.580 --> 04:30.260
been my fault.

55
04:32.100 --> 04:32.620
How so?

56
04:38.300 --> 04:39.100
My master...

57
04:40.100 --> 04:41.340
To help me,

58
04:41.940 --> 04:43.420
he told Grand Princess Luling

59
04:43.860 --> 04:45.340
about your situation.

60
04:46.300 --> 04:47.460
The Grand Princess

61
04:48.180 --> 04:49.020
took an interest in you.

62
04:49.780 --> 04:51.260
That's why you were taken away.

63
04:55.340 --> 04:55.780
(Li Zhi.)

64
04:56.900 --> 04:58.180
(I used to put up with your endless nagging)

65
04:59.100 --> 05:00.500
(and let it slide.)

66
05:01.420 --> 05:02.580
(But you went and confessed on your own)

67
05:03.260 --> 05:05.140
(that you forced my mother into marriage.)

68
05:06.260 --> 05:08.060
(And now you've dragged Yan Shang into this.)

69
05:09.220 --> 05:11.540
(It's time to settle all our scores, old and new,)

70
05:12.660 --> 05:14.020
(great and small.)

71
05:15.020 --> 05:15.980
(My dear uncle.)

72
05:19.620 --> 05:20.020
Fang Tong.

73
05:24.060 --> 05:24.940
What are your orders, Your Highness?

74
05:25.340 --> 05:26.940
I want to meet Yu Cheng'an's adviser.

75
05:27.420 --> 05:28.820
Wei Qiao, courtesy name Wei Zidu.

76
05:30.620 --> 05:31.180
Arrange a meeting.

77
05:33.940 --> 05:39.620
(Princess Danyang's Residence)

78
06:02.140 --> 06:02.500
Chunhua!

79
06:05.140 --> 06:05.820
(Princess Danyang's Residence) Chunhua! Chunhua!

80
06:06.300 --> 06:06.700
Chunhua!

81
06:08.700 --> 06:08.980
I...

82
06:14.060 --> 06:14.500
Chunhua.

83
06:16.020 --> 06:16.460
That day,

84
06:17.940 --> 06:18.860
I was drunk.

85
06:20.220 --> 06:21.540
I said many terrible things.

86
06:23.540 --> 06:24.540
I was too ashamed to face you.

87
06:24.780 --> 06:26.220
But after spending days shut away at home,

88
06:26.540 --> 06:27.620
I couldn't stop regretting what I'd done.

89
06:30.260 --> 06:30.820
I had to come

90
06:31.980 --> 06:32.540
and apologize to you.

91
06:33.940 --> 06:35.260
And to Yan Shang as well.

92
06:36.180 --> 06:37.260
Whether you two can forgive me or not...

93
06:37.660 --> 06:39.380
I don't know if Yan Shang will forgive you.

94
06:42.060 --> 06:43.300
Ask him yourself in a few days.

95
06:47.540 --> 06:48.900
I haven't seen him leave his place lately.

96
06:50.860 --> 06:51.540
He's injured.

97
06:52.060 --> 06:53.220
He's recovering at the Princess's residence.

98
06:54.180 --> 06:55.140
He... What happened to him?

99
06:57.780 --> 06:59.380
Ask him yourself once he's recovered.

100
07:00.300 --> 07:01.180
I don't want to talk to you.

101
07:02.180 --> 07:02.540
Chunhua!

102
07:03.820 --> 07:04.220
Chunhua!

103
07:09.060 --> 07:09.460
Chunhua!

104
07:13.820 --> 07:14.660
Watch where you're going!

105
07:15.460 --> 07:15.820
Sorry.

106
07:16.500 --> 07:16.900
My apologies.

107
07:30.460 --> 07:34.620
(Yang Residence)

108
07:38.420 --> 07:38.860
Chunhua.

109
07:41.740 --> 07:42.220
What about you?

110
07:43.740 --> 07:44.620
Can you forgive me?

111
07:51.260 --> 07:52.540
I'll have to think about that.

112
07:53.540 --> 07:53.940
Okay.

113
07:54.340 --> 07:54.660
Sure.

114
07:55.060 --> 07:55.660
Take your time.

115
07:56.140 --> 07:56.660
Think it over carefully.

116
07:57.380 --> 07:57.780
I'll wait for you.

117
08:12.540 --> 08:13.380
Well, enough talking.

118
08:14.020 --> 08:15.220
The Princess gave me the day off.

119
08:15.460 --> 08:16.300
I'm heading home soon.

120
08:16.900 --> 08:17.220
All right.

121
08:18.340 --> 08:19.780
Then take care on your way home.

122
08:24.660 --> 08:24.900
Well...

123
08:25.380 --> 08:26.860
I'll settle things with you when I get back.

124
08:27.980 --> 08:28.820
You still want to see me again?

125
08:31.180 --> 08:32.060
You're still willing to settle things with me?

126
08:36.900 --> 08:40.780
(Yang Residence)

127
08:40.780 --> 08:41.900
Just go home.

128
08:42.020 --> 08:42.780
Stop standing around.

129
08:44.820 --> 08:45.100
All right.

130
08:46.780 --> 08:47.420
I'll wait for you to come back.

131
08:49.980 --> 08:50.220
Well...

132
08:50.580 --> 08:51.420
I'll be going, then.

133
08:51.780 --> 08:52.420
Okay, go ahead.

134
08:56.300 --> 09:00.220
(Yang Residence)

135
09:48.820 --> 09:55.810
(Rising Sun, Waxing Moon)

136
10:21.540 --> 10:22.420
Greetings, Your Highness.

137
10:23.580 --> 10:24.500
No need for formalities, Wei Qiao.

138
10:26.020 --> 10:26.860
I'm deeply honored.

139
10:27.340 --> 10:28.540
May I ask why Your Highness

140
10:28.860 --> 10:29.740
has summoned me?

141
10:30.980 --> 10:34.180
Everyone in Sheng'an knows how talented you are, Mr. Wei.

142
10:35.060 --> 10:36.260
What could I possibly teach you?

143
10:38.700 --> 10:39.380
Mr. Wei,

144
10:40.420 --> 10:41.380
I've made some inquiries.

145
10:42.220 --> 10:42.940
You...

146
10:43.180 --> 10:44.300
you're not wed yet, are you?

147
10:47.580 --> 10:48.260
Your Highness,

148
10:48.700 --> 10:49.300
what is it?

149
10:52.180 --> 10:54.260
I've been terribly troubled these past few days.

150
10:54.980 --> 10:55.780
A few days ago,

151
10:56.140 --> 10:57.700
Father wanted me to marry the third-place scholar.

152
10:58.300 --> 10:59.020
I refused.

153
11:00.220 --> 11:01.220
Have you heard about that?

154
11:02.740 --> 11:03.420
I have heard something of it.

155
11:05.620 --> 11:06.540
Then you must also know

156
11:07.860 --> 11:09.980
that my first marriage was far from happy.

157
11:10.860 --> 11:12.020
Now that I'm seeking another husband,

158
11:12.340 --> 11:13.140
I must choose carefully.

159
11:14.340 --> 11:16.380
That third-place scholar may have some talent,

160
11:16.700 --> 11:17.820
but he's just a peasant.

161
11:18.540 --> 11:19.740
I certainly can't marry him.

162
11:21.620 --> 11:22.700
There's an elder in my family

163
11:23.740 --> 11:25.620
who's taken a great interest in my marriage.

164
11:26.740 --> 11:27.900
He keeps insisting

165
11:28.060 --> 11:30.020
that I marry someone from the Wei family.

166
11:31.180 --> 11:32.260
I've met his choice,

167
11:32.860 --> 11:34.380
but I simply don't like the fellow.

168
11:35.060 --> 11:36.260
Born to a concubine in a lesser branch,

169
11:36.500 --> 11:37.340
with neither parent alive...

170
11:37.580 --> 11:38.380
What future could he possibly have?

171
11:40.460 --> 11:41.460
After giving it some thought,

172
11:42.500 --> 11:44.660
if I must marry someone from your family,

173
11:45.980 --> 11:47.100
the most sought-after young man of the Wei family

174
11:47.540 --> 11:49.140
in all of Sheng'an

175
11:49.980 --> 11:50.780
is none other than you.

176
11:52.340 --> 11:53.220
Besides,

177
11:53.860 --> 11:55.860
you're much more to my taste.

178
11:58.020 --> 11:58.980
I'm unworthy of your affection, Your Highness.

179
12:00.260 --> 12:00.820
Unworthy?

180
12:00.980 --> 12:01.380
Yes.

181
12:02.500 --> 12:03.380
I'm not so fortunate.

182
12:03.820 --> 12:05.660
I have no intention of marrying.

183
12:06.140 --> 12:07.180
You dare reject me?

184
12:11.780 --> 12:12.660
It seems, Mr. Wei,

185
12:13.100 --> 12:14.740
you're willing to let such an extraordinary opportunity

186
12:14.900 --> 12:15.700
slip through your fingers.

187
12:16.460 --> 12:17.220
I don't believe it.

188
12:18.340 --> 12:19.900
Haven't you heard

189
12:20.300 --> 12:21.420
the prophecy about me?

190
12:27.020 --> 12:28.260
The daughter of Yaoguang Star

191
12:28.700 --> 12:29.700
shall bring glory to the royal house.

192
12:30.980 --> 12:31.820
Whoever marries me...

193
12:31.820 --> 12:32.300
Your Highness.

194
12:33.620 --> 12:34.220
What?

195
12:34.820 --> 12:35.780
Perhaps you needn't marry me

196
12:35.780 --> 12:37.940
to solve your troubles.

197
12:38.860 --> 12:39.580
May I ask

198
12:40.020 --> 12:42.420
who's forcing you to marry into the Wei family?

199
12:46.620 --> 12:47.340
I can't tell you.

200
12:48.420 --> 12:48.940
After all,

201
12:49.780 --> 12:50.780
he only wants what's best for me.

202
12:52.660 --> 12:54.780
And which illegitimate son of the Wei family

203
12:55.260 --> 12:56.140
has been chosen to marry you?

204
12:56.740 --> 12:57.700
I can't tell you that either.

205
12:58.580 --> 12:59.380
After all,

206
13:00.180 --> 13:01.380
he's your rival in love.

207
13:05.860 --> 13:08.180
If Your Highness won't tell me, so be it.

208
13:10.300 --> 13:10.700
I'll take my leave.

209
13:12.700 --> 13:14.020
You really can't marry me?

210
13:23.060 --> 13:23.580
Your Highness,

211
13:24.140 --> 13:25.300
if my guess is correct,

212
13:25.740 --> 13:26.340
your elder

213
13:26.340 --> 13:28.540
must have close ties to that young man of the Wei family.

214
13:28.660 --> 13:29.900
That's why he's forcing you to marry him.

215
13:30.780 --> 13:32.220
So even if you married me,

216
13:32.420 --> 13:33.900
it wouldn't silence your elder.

217
13:34.340 --> 13:34.740
He

218
13:35.260 --> 13:36.980
certainly wouldn't let it go.

219
13:38.460 --> 13:39.820
You're both Weis, after all.

220
13:42.140 --> 13:43.820
I'm afraid I can't help you.

221
13:45.700 --> 13:46.140
One more thing.

222
13:46.820 --> 13:47.820
Forgive me for speaking out of turn,

223
13:48.420 --> 13:51.460
but that prophecy concerning Your Highness...

224
13:52.220 --> 13:54.260
You shouldn't mention it so freely in the future.

225
13:54.980 --> 13:56.060
It's a prophecy of great fortune.

226
13:56.380 --> 13:57.220
Why shouldn't I mention it?

227
14:01.420 --> 14:02.300
Don't worry.

228
14:03.140 --> 14:04.540
I won't throw myself at you.

229
14:05.660 --> 14:07.580
There are plenty of young men in the Wei family.

230
14:08.340 --> 14:10.380
And plenty of men eager to marry me for my destiny!

231
14:11.060 --> 14:12.060
I'm sure I'll find

232
14:12.060 --> 14:13.300
a husband who suits me!

233
14:17.220 --> 14:19.060
(Dong'e Ejiao)

234
14:21.820 --> 14:24.580
(Chunhua's Home)

235
14:25.700 --> 14:26.940
Mother! Brother! Sister-in-law!

236
14:26.940 --> 14:27.500
I'm home!

237
14:27.980 --> 14:29.300
(Chunhua's Brother) Mother, Chunhua's back!

238
14:29.300 --> 14:31.380
(Chunhua's Sister-in-law)

239
14:33.380 --> 14:34.060
(Chunhua's Mother) Chunhua!

240
14:35.220 --> 14:35.500
Mother.

241
14:35.940 --> 14:36.700
You're home.

242
14:43.100 --> 14:44.060
You look like you've put on a little weight.

243
14:46.700 --> 14:46.980
Mother,

244
14:47.260 --> 14:48.020
I brought back

245
14:48.020 --> 14:49.220
lots of lovely gifts from the Princess.

246
14:51.260 --> 14:51.500
Oh...

247
14:51.980 --> 14:52.940
(Dong'e Ejiao) Keep this. It's good for your health.

248
14:52.940 --> 14:54.340
(Dong'e Ejiao)

249
14:54.500 --> 14:54.780
All right.

250
14:57.580 --> 14:57.820
Well...

251
14:58.780 --> 14:59.260
Sister-in-law,

252
15:00.380 --> 15:01.020
this is for you.

253
15:03.740 --> 15:04.740
There's something for me too?

254
15:05.820 --> 15:06.940
You must've had a tiring journey.

255
15:06.940 --> 15:07.420
Thank you.

256
15:09.060 --> 15:10.060
Come, sit here.

257
15:11.780 --> 15:12.700
Are you tired? Sit.

258
15:13.180 --> 15:13.500
Not at all.

259
15:15.580 --> 15:16.180
Chunhua,

260
15:16.580 --> 15:17.700
you may be a maid,

261
15:18.180 --> 15:18.620
but I'd say

262
15:18.860 --> 15:21.140
you're better off than the daughters of many wealthy families!

263
15:22.340 --> 15:22.740
Look,

264
15:23.420 --> 15:24.580
the Princess gave me this fabric.

265
15:24.900 --> 15:26.460
You can use it to make yourself some new clothes.

266
15:27.660 --> 15:28.100
Mother.

267
15:28.500 --> 15:29.260
It's beautiful.

268
15:30.020 --> 15:30.300
Brother.

269
15:31.300 --> 15:31.660
What is it?

270
15:33.620 --> 15:34.660
These are the wages I've saved.

271
15:35.220 --> 15:36.300
Use them for household expenses.

272
15:37.740 --> 15:38.020
Okay.

273
15:38.860 --> 15:39.300
You've grown up.

274
15:41.540 --> 15:42.100
Chunhua,

275
15:42.380 --> 15:44.740
it seems you're really in the Princess's good graces.

276
15:45.140 --> 15:45.580
Chunhua,

277
15:46.660 --> 15:48.500
you've served the Princess for so long.

278
15:48.820 --> 15:50.860
Could you put in a word with her

279
15:51.380 --> 15:52.980
and ask her to find me a position?

280
15:53.540 --> 15:54.900
(Dong'e Ejiao)

281
15:54.900 --> 15:56.060
A position at the Princess's residence?

282
15:56.180 --> 15:57.620
I'm just a maid. I can't ask her for something like that.

283
16:01.820 --> 16:02.580
That's true.

284
16:03.860 --> 16:05.820
After all, the Princess is just a widow.

285
16:06.380 --> 16:07.260
She's only a woman.

286
16:07.820 --> 16:08.740
Whether she can arrange anything

287
16:09.620 --> 16:10.260
is another matter.

288
16:11.660 --> 16:12.500
(Dong'e Ejiao) Exactly.

289
16:21.860 --> 16:22.460
Chunhua,

290
16:23.660 --> 16:25.060
how many days can you stay this time?

291
16:26.340 --> 16:26.660
Mother,

292
16:27.060 --> 16:28.140
the Princess treats me so well.

293
16:28.420 --> 16:29.500
She gave me three whole days off.

294
16:31.100 --> 16:33.140
You call that treating you well?

295
16:34.060 --> 16:36.500
If she could find you a good husband,

296
16:37.060 --> 16:38.420
preferably an official,

297
16:39.380 --> 16:41.220
someone who could bring honor to our family,

298
16:41.660 --> 16:43.180
now that would be treating you well!

299
16:44.660 --> 16:45.660
Mother's absolutely right.

300
16:46.140 --> 16:46.580
Chunhua,

301
16:48.100 --> 16:50.620
the Princess's residence is a place of great wealth and privilege.

302
16:51.140 --> 16:53.060
All sorts of powerful officials and nobles visit.

303
16:54.140 --> 16:57.020
Have you met anyone suitable for marriage?

304
16:57.740 --> 16:58.180
If you have,

305
16:58.820 --> 16:59.700
you should ask the Princess about him!

306
17:00.260 --> 17:00.540
(Dong'e Ejiao) Exactly.

307
17:02.780 --> 17:04.940
Preferably a high-ranking official.

308
17:08.580 --> 17:09.820
The higher his rank, the better!

309
17:10.380 --> 17:10.940
And if

310
17:11.340 --> 17:13.900
he could help your brother get ahead, even better.

311
17:18.180 --> 17:18.700
Anyone come to mind?

312
17:20.740 --> 17:21.300
Think.

313
17:21.620 --> 17:22.060
Think about it.

314
17:22.220 --> 17:22.700
Anyone?

315
17:25.580 --> 17:25.860
Mother,

316
17:26.700 --> 17:27.660
it's been so long since I was home.

317
17:28.180 --> 17:28.900
I'll go take a look out back.

318
17:30.420 --> 17:31.700
What's there to see out back?

319
17:34.220 --> 17:35.780
Aren't there lots of wildflowers growing there?

320
17:37.060 --> 17:37.940
I'll pick some.

321
17:39.820 --> 17:40.620
You're a grown woman.

322
17:40.620 --> 17:41.860
Why are you still picking flowers?

323
17:42.220 --> 17:43.420
Acting like a child.

324
17:44.100 --> 17:46.420
I think Chunhua's gotten used to living in luxury.

325
17:46.860 --> 17:47.860
Now that she's home,

326
17:48.180 --> 17:49.820
nothing here is good enough for her.

327
17:50.940 --> 17:51.180
I...

328
17:52.100 --> 17:53.260
Let me take a look!

329
17:53.380 --> 17:54.100
She gave it to me!

330
17:55.020 --> 17:55.340
You little...

331
17:55.580 --> 17:56.180
I'm hungry, Mother.

332
17:56.540 --> 17:56.860
Cook.

333
18:02.060 --> 18:03.900
What a nuisance!

334
18:05.180 --> 18:06.260
That woman.

335
18:08.140 --> 18:10.660
All she wants is to keep me cooped up at home.

336
18:10.940 --> 18:11.300
Your Highness,

337
18:12.020 --> 18:13.300
(Mu Ti, Prince of Jin) where shall we go hunting today?

338
18:14.300 --> 18:15.460
Hunting? Who said anything about hunting?

339
18:15.940 --> 18:16.740
That's exhausting.

340
18:19.020 --> 18:21.700
Let's just find ourselves a nice hill today

341
18:22.380 --> 18:23.060
and take a stroll.

342
18:23.980 --> 18:24.940
We'll walk until nightfall

343
18:26.220 --> 18:27.100
before heading home.

344
18:28.620 --> 18:30.420
So tiresome!

345
18:38.340 --> 18:39.780
What's a young lady doing here?

346
18:47.620 --> 18:48.660
How can you be so careless?

347
18:55.540 --> 18:56.180
Are you blind?

348
18:56.340 --> 18:56.900
You hit me!

349
18:57.060 --> 18:57.980
Watch your mouth!

350
18:57.980 --> 18:59.180
You watch yours!

351
19:00.260 --> 19:00.900
How rude!

352
19:02.460 --> 19:04.060
You're not hurt, are you, Miss?

353
19:06.300 --> 19:08.540
I'm afraid I haven't disciplined my men properly.

354
19:09.180 --> 19:10.260
They've caused you quite a fright.

355
19:10.820 --> 19:11.420
Allow me

356
19:13.060 --> 19:13.620
to apologize.

357
19:18.980 --> 19:19.940
Greetings, Prince of Jin.

358
19:22.060 --> 19:23.620
You recognize me?

359
19:24.900 --> 19:25.300
Of course.

360
19:26.100 --> 19:27.900
I serve at Princess Danyang's residence.

361
19:30.700 --> 19:32.780
So you're one of her servants.

362
19:33.140 --> 19:34.780
What a coincidence.

363
19:35.780 --> 19:36.500
May I ask why

364
19:36.500 --> 19:39.180
you're out here in the wilderness all alone?

365
19:39.460 --> 19:40.020
Aren't you

366
19:41.260 --> 19:42.500
afraid of running into wild beasts?

367
19:43.020 --> 19:44.220
The Princess gave me the day off

368
19:44.700 --> 19:45.740
to visit my family.

369
19:46.660 --> 19:47.500
You're right, Your Highness.

370
19:47.820 --> 19:48.740
I'll return to the residence at once.

371
19:49.220 --> 19:50.180
Wait a moment, young lady.

372
19:56.540 --> 19:59.140
This hill is mostly covered in wildflowers and grass.

373
20:00.060 --> 20:01.220
If Your Highness wishes to hunt,

374
20:01.780 --> 20:03.380
there's more game on the hill to the west.

375
20:03.580 --> 20:05.020
That's not what I wanted to ask.

376
20:05.660 --> 20:06.900
What I meant was...

377
20:09.060 --> 20:10.700
It's hot, and I'm rather thirsty.

378
20:11.780 --> 20:13.180
I was hoping for a bowl of water.

379
20:13.300 --> 20:15.220
You must live nearby, young lady.

380
20:15.580 --> 20:16.140
Would it

381
20:16.500 --> 20:17.660
be too much trouble?

382
20:21.420 --> 20:21.740
Well...

383
20:23.180 --> 20:24.140
Please follow me, Your Highness.

384
20:24.780 --> 20:25.340
One moment.

385
20:33.660 --> 20:34.620
(Your Highness, allow us.)

386
20:34.620 --> 20:34.940
No.

387
20:35.580 --> 20:36.140
I'll do it myself.

388
20:45.620 --> 20:45.980
Lead the way.

389
21:07.740 --> 21:09.100
Mother! Brother! Sister-in-law!

390
21:09.260 --> 21:10.060
We have an honored guest!

391
21:10.820 --> 21:12.140
You stay outside.

392
21:21.340 --> 21:22.860
Who's that man?

393
21:25.180 --> 21:26.660
She went up the hill to pick flowers

394
21:26.740 --> 21:27.900
and came back with a man?

395
21:32.980 --> 21:33.620
Please, have some tea.

396
21:45.020 --> 21:46.860
Why is this tea so sweet?

397
21:55.380 --> 21:57.020
Mother, Brother, Sister-in-law.

398
21:57.820 --> 21:59.580
I just remembered an urgent task the Princess gave me.

399
21:59.940 --> 22:00.860
I must return to her residence now.

400
22:04.210 --> 22:07.040
- Hey! Wait! - Hey!

401
22:07.340 --> 22:07.860
Please, have some tea.

402
22:10.540 --> 22:11.940
Enjoy your tea.

403
22:18.220 --> 22:19.100
To tell you the truth,

404
22:19.900 --> 22:20.820
my younger sister

405
22:20.820 --> 22:22.700
now works at Princess Danyang's residence.

406
22:22.940 --> 22:24.180
She's the Princess's

407
22:24.820 --> 22:25.940
most trusted attendant.

408
22:30.820 --> 22:33.460
Princess Danyang certainly knows how to train her servants.

409
22:38.060 --> 22:39.620
Your humble family has certainly

410
22:39.620 --> 22:41.460
produced a golden phoenix.

411
22:42.420 --> 22:43.140
Today,

412
22:44.180 --> 22:44.820
I must say,

413
22:45.700 --> 22:47.220
this trip was well worth my while.

414
22:51.540 --> 22:53.140
I failed to recognize Your Highness.

415
22:53.540 --> 22:54.860
Please forgive me.

416
22:56.540 --> 22:57.740
Mother. Mother. He's a prince.

417
22:57.740 --> 22:58.260
Your Highness.

418
23:02.380 --> 23:04.580
How old is your daughter?

419
23:05.740 --> 23:06.580
Is she

420
23:07.940 --> 23:08.860
engaged to someone?

421
23:17.220 --> 23:17.740
Smells so lovely.

422
23:23.020 --> 23:23.460
Your Highness.

423
23:29.220 --> 23:30.340
Why are you home so late?

424
23:32.260 --> 23:34.060
I had nothing to do today,

425
23:34.540 --> 23:35.780
so I went outside the city for some fresh air.

426
23:37.340 --> 23:38.620
So what did you catch today?

427
23:42.820 --> 23:44.780
Heaven cherishes all living creatures.

428
23:44.780 --> 23:47.060
I simply couldn't bear to kill anything.

429
23:47.780 --> 23:49.220
If you fancy some wild game,

430
23:49.700 --> 23:51.140
have the servants buy some tomorrow.

431
23:52.020 --> 23:52.500
Sit down.

432
23:55.620 --> 23:57.260
You've been out all day, Your Highness.

433
23:57.780 --> 23:58.580
You must be tired.

434
24:00.220 --> 24:00.500
Come on.

435
24:01.420 --> 24:01.860
Let me

436
24:02.940 --> 24:03.780
give you a massage.

437
24:06.740 --> 24:08.220
No, no. I'm not tired.

438
24:08.700 --> 24:09.860
I... I was just

439
24:11.300 --> 24:12.300
heading to my study.

440
24:12.740 --> 24:12.980
Yes!

441
24:13.500 --> 24:14.020
My study!

442
24:14.860 --> 24:15.260
Your Highness!

443
24:15.740 --> 24:16.100
Your Highness!

444
24:22.380 --> 24:22.820
Bicao,

445
24:23.420 --> 24:24.220
do you think I'm getting old?

446
24:25.420 --> 24:27.020
Your Highness is a natural beauty.

447
24:27.260 --> 24:27.980
And you take such good care of yourself.

448
24:28.180 --> 24:29.180
How could you possibly look old?

449
24:32.060 --> 24:32.580
Indeed.

450
24:33.180 --> 24:33.940
I'm not old yet,

451
24:34.780 --> 24:36.180
yet the Prince is already casting me aside.

452
24:42.060 --> 24:45.740
(Pingkang Ward)

453
24:45.740 --> 24:46.300
Brother.

454
24:50.300 --> 24:51.540
What's going on

455
24:52.100 --> 24:52.980
between you and Princess Danyang?

456
24:53.780 --> 24:54.260
Brother...

457
24:54.260 --> 24:55.020
Stay away from her.

458
24:55.860 --> 24:58.620
The Wei family must have nothing to do with that prophecy.

459
25:01.220 --> 25:02.300
Princess Danyang and I

460
25:02.740 --> 25:03.500
have done nothing improper.

461
25:03.820 --> 25:04.540
There's nothing between us.

462
25:11.140 --> 25:11.820
Good.

463
25:16.140 --> 25:16.860
To think...

464
25:17.260 --> 25:18.740
We haven't seen each other in so long,

465
25:19.460 --> 25:20.380
yet when we finally meet,

466
25:20.740 --> 25:22.620
it's over something so absurd.

467
25:27.380 --> 25:27.820
Let me.

468
25:46.900 --> 25:47.540
You've grown up

469
25:48.220 --> 25:49.260
and certainly matured.

470
25:52.020 --> 25:53.340
Back at the family estate,

471
25:54.300 --> 25:55.380
you always looked out for me.

472
25:56.900 --> 25:57.460
This cup,

473
25:58.580 --> 25:59.260
I'd like to drink to you.

474
25:59.820 --> 26:00.060
No.

475
26:01.220 --> 26:01.900
This cup

476
26:02.620 --> 26:04.180
should celebrate your success as the Top Scholar.

477
26:14.100 --> 26:16.980
There were so many children in the Wei family back then.

478
26:17.620 --> 26:19.020
Though you lost your father at a young age,

479
26:19.220 --> 26:20.700
you were the brightest of them all.

480
26:21.500 --> 26:23.020
I remember, even as a little boy,

481
26:23.180 --> 26:24.860
you wrote better poetry than I did.

482
26:26.300 --> 26:29.660
Our family tutor praised your poetry for its bold, spirited style.

483
26:30.620 --> 26:31.900
How old were you then?

484
26:33.620 --> 26:34.020
Six?

485
26:37.300 --> 26:38.220
The Wei family is large,

486
26:38.740 --> 26:40.140
but you were the only one who respected me.

487
26:43.340 --> 26:44.940
You were young back then,

488
26:45.140 --> 26:46.140
but you kept your thoughts to yourself.

489
26:46.900 --> 26:49.340
Our family had many branches, and everyone had something to say.

490
26:49.460 --> 26:50.620
Most of them were snobs.

491
26:51.700 --> 26:52.380
Back then,

492
26:53.020 --> 26:54.660
did someone say something cruel

493
26:55.340 --> 26:56.500
that made you decide to leave?

494
26:59.940 --> 27:01.820
I lived at the family estate until I was fourteen.

495
27:02.300 --> 27:03.180
They'd already been generous enough.

496
27:04.220 --> 27:05.580
I couldn't shamelessly impose on them any longer.

497
27:11.900 --> 27:12.180
Cheers.

498
27:24.580 --> 27:25.620
Looking back,

499
27:26.020 --> 27:27.060
it seems life treated you

500
27:27.580 --> 27:28.180
rather better

501
27:28.660 --> 27:29.860
after you left the family.

502
27:33.740 --> 27:34.220
I...

503
27:35.180 --> 27:36.340
met my mentor.

504
27:37.620 --> 27:38.580
Li...

505
27:39.420 --> 27:39.860
Zhi.

506
27:41.820 --> 27:44.300
I recall he's the late Empress's elder brother.

507
27:44.780 --> 27:46.140
He's always been an ambitious schemer,

508
27:46.140 --> 27:47.220
pretending to be a patron of the arts.

509
27:47.620 --> 27:48.500
He has many proteges.

510
27:51.500 --> 27:52.700
My mentor gave me food and lodging

511
27:53.300 --> 27:54.740
and let me study at his home.

512
27:55.300 --> 27:56.380
Now that you've topped the exams,

513
27:56.860 --> 27:58.260
you've brought honor to his household too.

514
27:59.620 --> 28:00.380
But I heard

515
28:00.380 --> 28:01.860
that Li Zhi's own son

516
28:01.860 --> 28:03.140
has no talent for studying.

517
28:03.460 --> 28:04.300
So he sponsors

518
28:04.300 --> 28:06.380
over a hundred gifted scholars,

519
28:06.380 --> 28:07.380
hedging his bets.

520
28:07.900 --> 28:09.660
He makes them treat him as their father.

521
28:10.940 --> 28:11.740
Does he

522
28:12.380 --> 28:13.700
treat you the same way?

523
28:17.540 --> 28:19.540
My mentor gave me a second chance at life.

524
28:20.260 --> 28:21.340
Of course I should...

525
28:21.340 --> 28:22.060
Should what?

526
28:23.340 --> 28:24.380
If he tells you to go east,

527
28:25.700 --> 28:26.780
you wouldn't dare go west.

528
28:35.060 --> 28:35.620
Shu,

529
28:36.980 --> 28:38.620
the hardest debts to repay

530
28:39.340 --> 28:40.500
are debts of gratitude.

531
28:42.060 --> 28:43.900
Know your own limits.

532
28:45.340 --> 28:46.820
Don't end up sacrificing

533
28:47.940 --> 28:48.780
your entire life to repay him.

534
28:59.660 --> 29:01.060
(That fool Li Zhi.)

535
29:01.780 --> 29:03.780
(Now that he's crossed that foolish Mu Wanyao,)

536
29:05.260 --> 29:07.740
(who knows what trouble he'll stir up?)

537
29:08.580 --> 29:10.020
(He could drag the entire Wei family into it.)

538
29:11.540 --> 29:13.060
(Yintaimen)

539
29:13.060 --> 29:15.380
(Yintaimen Investigation Office)

540
29:22.420 --> 29:23.060
- (Sir.) - (Sir.)

541
29:24.620 --> 29:25.140
(Sir.)

542
29:26.420 --> 29:26.780
Mr. Wei.

543
29:32.140 --> 29:32.820
Sir.

544
29:36.740 --> 29:37.340
Li Zhi.

545
29:38.140 --> 29:39.900
The one from Princess Danyang's maternal family.

546
29:40.580 --> 29:41.340
Go investigate him.

547
29:41.740 --> 29:42.020
Yes, sir.

548
29:42.500 --> 29:44.260
(Wang Qing, Chen Lian, Yintaimen Eunuchs) We'll report back within two days.

549
29:44.620 --> 29:45.060
Half a day.

550
29:48.740 --> 29:49.060
Yes, sir.

551
29:52.260 --> 29:53.260
After half a day,

552
29:53.500 --> 29:55.940
whether you find anything or not,

553
29:56.500 --> 29:57.900
there's no need to report back.

554
29:58.900 --> 30:00.860
Give your findings directly to the court censors

555
30:01.660 --> 30:02.380
and have him impeached.

556
30:09.660 --> 30:10.460
Qiongzhou sounds good.

557
30:11.260 --> 30:11.860
Send him there.

558
30:12.820 --> 30:13.140
Yes, sir.

559
30:18.340 --> 30:21.100
Qiongzhou is quite a place!

560
30:22.220 --> 30:24.580
A land full of poisonous miasma.

561
30:25.060 --> 30:28.420
Who could have angered you so, Mr. Wei?

562
30:28.420 --> 30:29.660
I'm not angry.

563
30:30.100 --> 30:31.540
I just find it utterly ridiculous.

564
30:32.460 --> 30:33.420
There's nothing I despise more

565
30:34.900 --> 30:36.260
than fools.

566
30:47.740 --> 30:48.460
Miss Chunhua.

567
30:55.140 --> 30:55.860
Was this your doing?

568
30:56.900 --> 30:57.780
You mean my uncle?

569
30:59.780 --> 31:00.740
Has the imperial decree arrived already?

570
31:02.660 --> 31:03.180
That was quick.

571
31:04.100 --> 31:05.140
Li Zhi, Vice Director at the Ministry of Rites,

572
31:05.500 --> 31:06.740
has been demoted to Marshal of Qiongzhou for bribery.

573
31:07.220 --> 31:08.020
He's ordered to leave the capital immediately.

574
31:08.700 --> 31:09.220
So it was you.

575
31:10.460 --> 31:10.900
Then...

576
31:11.940 --> 31:13.180
What Wei Shu told me the other day...

577
31:13.900 --> 31:14.620
You heard everything?

578
31:14.860 --> 31:16.980
If I could rescue you from Grand Princess Luling,

579
31:17.820 --> 31:18.740
I can certainly deal with

580
31:19.060 --> 31:21.180
the man responsible for putting you through that ordeal.

581
31:22.180 --> 31:23.580
Now you've seen what I'm capable of.

582
31:24.500 --> 31:24.900
Well?

583
31:25.580 --> 31:26.580
Still dare to upset me like that?

584
31:30.420 --> 31:30.820
Your Highness,

585
31:32.620 --> 31:34.020
you didn't have to go this far for me.

586
31:34.460 --> 31:36.020
You may be willing to swallow this insult,

587
31:36.580 --> 31:37.380
but I certainly won't.

588
31:38.740 --> 31:40.020
I had Li Zhi thrown out of Sheng'an,

589
31:40.780 --> 31:41.580
and not just because of you.

590
31:42.180 --> 31:43.260
I have my own reasons.

591
31:44.660 --> 31:46.580
Just accept what I've done for you.

592
31:47.140 --> 31:49.220
And spare me any more of that irritating nonsense.

593
31:50.220 --> 31:51.140
How did you manage it?

594
31:53.420 --> 31:54.460
What else but the Yintaimen

595
31:54.980 --> 31:56.180
could have acted so quickly?

596
31:59.900 --> 32:01.100
You used Yu Cheng'an to do your work.

597
32:02.180 --> 32:02.540
Your Highness,

598
32:04.260 --> 32:05.660
you're making a deal with a tiger.

599
32:06.020 --> 32:06.980
And I got what I wanted.

600
32:08.380 --> 32:08.820
Didn't I?

601
32:23.980 --> 32:24.460
Thank you.

602
32:46.380 --> 32:47.140
(Then I'll take you there.)

603
32:47.380 --> 32:48.380
(Sweets for sale! Make way!)

604
32:50.900 --> 32:51.740
(Let's have a look over there.)

605
32:51.940 --> 32:52.260
Wenji.

606
32:54.540 --> 32:54.860
Shang.

607
32:56.100 --> 32:57.100
Don't stand in the draft.

608
32:57.780 --> 32:58.020
Come.

609
32:58.540 --> 32:59.060
Let's talk inside.

610
33:01.820 --> 33:02.220
Come on.

611
33:09.940 --> 33:10.340
Shang.

612
33:11.140 --> 33:11.660
I...

613
33:12.540 --> 33:14.500
I've been wondering when you'd come to see me.

614
33:15.060 --> 33:15.540
I never thought

615
33:15.980 --> 33:17.700
I'd be waiting all these days.

616
33:20.780 --> 33:21.060
Shang,

617
33:21.940 --> 33:22.340
that day...

618
33:23.020 --> 33:23.820
Thank you for coming to see me.

619
33:25.300 --> 33:25.700
Wenji,

620
33:26.300 --> 33:26.860
do you remember

621
33:26.980 --> 33:28.460
when we studied together at the local school?

622
33:29.900 --> 33:30.740
Whenever you helped me,

623
33:31.660 --> 33:32.300
and I tried to thank you,

624
33:32.980 --> 33:33.620
you'd always say,

625
33:34.180 --> 33:35.980
"There's no need for thanks between friends."

626
33:37.100 --> 33:37.460
Now,

627
33:38.180 --> 33:39.260
it's my turn to say that to you.

628
33:43.820 --> 33:44.220
Shang.

629
33:45.500 --> 33:45.940
I'm sorry.

630
33:48.820 --> 33:49.980
And there's even less need to apologize.

631
33:51.220 --> 33:52.100
Now and always,

632
33:52.380 --> 33:53.340
no matter when or where,

633
33:54.020 --> 33:54.580
to me,

634
33:55.140 --> 33:56.660
you'll always be my dear schoolmate and friend,

635
33:57.140 --> 33:57.660
Wenji.

636
34:07.380 --> 34:08.420
Chunhua said you were injured.

637
34:08.780 --> 34:09.060
What...

638
34:09.300 --> 34:09.860
What happened?

639
34:10.220 --> 34:11.020
Just some minor wounds.

640
34:11.620 --> 34:12.460
I'm almost fully recovered.

641
34:14.140 --> 34:15.220
You've seen Chunhua?

642
34:20.820 --> 34:21.700
The more I thought about it,

643
34:22.340 --> 34:23.420
the worse I felt about what I did to her.

644
34:24.100 --> 34:24.580
And to you.

645
34:26.060 --> 34:26.860
But you were nowhere to be found.

646
34:27.340 --> 34:28.180
Then Chunhua came out

647
34:28.500 --> 34:29.820
and told me you were recovering at the Princess's residence.

648
34:31.380 --> 34:32.020
So, have you two

649
34:32.580 --> 34:33.220
made up?

650
34:36.740 --> 34:37.300
She said

651
34:38.940 --> 34:39.700
she needed more time to think.

652
34:40.980 --> 34:42.060
Then there's still hope.

653
34:47.580 --> 34:47.860
Shang,

654
34:48.740 --> 34:50.940
I bought this lip rouge for Chunhua.

655
34:52.060 --> 34:53.940
You can come and go from the Princess's residence freely.

656
34:54.500 --> 34:55.140
Could you

657
34:56.300 --> 34:56.940
give it to her for me?

658
34:59.580 --> 34:59.820
Of course.

659
35:03.460 --> 35:04.860
(Hurry up! Is all the food packed?)

660
35:04.860 --> 35:05.540
- (Get moving.) - (Time to go.)

661
35:05.900 --> 35:06.260
(Don't worry.)

662
35:06.380 --> 35:07.500
(Thanks for looking after me on the journey.)

663
35:07.500 --> 35:08.300
(Get some rest while you can.)

664
35:08.500 --> 35:09.060
(Thank you.)

665
35:09.940 --> 35:10.540
(Don't mention it.)

666
35:11.340 --> 35:11.860
(Have something to eat.)

667
35:11.860 --> 35:12.220
(Here.)

668
35:12.540 --> 35:12.940
(Get some rest.)

669
35:12.940 --> 35:13.580
(Sit down for a while.)

670
35:27.860 --> 35:28.460
How thoughtful of you

671
35:29.260 --> 35:30.500
to come see me off.

672
35:32.620 --> 35:34.100
At my age,

673
35:35.260 --> 35:36.860
I don't know if I'll survive

674
35:36.860 --> 35:38.980
the poisonous miasma of that savage land.

675
35:41.540 --> 35:42.100
Wanyao,

676
35:42.900 --> 35:44.620
for all I've done

677
35:44.900 --> 35:46.260
for you and your mother,

678
35:46.580 --> 35:47.900
please find a way to help me.

679
35:48.820 --> 35:50.100
If there's any way to reverse this...

680
35:50.100 --> 35:50.500
Uncle,

681
35:51.220 --> 35:51.980
what are you talking about?

682
35:53.340 --> 35:54.580
This decree demoting you

683
35:55.460 --> 35:56.940
is my gift to you.

684
35:58.060 --> 35:58.380
What...

685
35:59.860 --> 36:00.700
What did you say?

686
36:04.180 --> 36:04.620
Uncle,

687
36:05.820 --> 36:06.540
in the past,

688
36:07.020 --> 36:08.340
you forced my mother into marriage.

689
36:09.340 --> 36:10.780
Now you're trying to sell me off too.

690
36:12.940 --> 36:13.340
Oh, and

691
36:14.220 --> 36:15.660
you nearly sold off my man as well.

692
36:16.740 --> 36:17.420
Wanyao.

693
36:18.900 --> 36:21.300
You're becoming more shameless and unruly by the day!

694
36:22.220 --> 36:23.100
How can you say

695
36:23.220 --> 36:25.340
such indecent things?

696
36:26.060 --> 36:26.420
Uncle,

697
36:28.460 --> 36:29.260
all your life,

698
36:29.820 --> 36:31.500
you've made your fortune

699
36:32.140 --> 36:33.100
by selling others off.

700
36:33.700 --> 36:35.500
You've traded their blood and tears

701
36:35.940 --> 36:36.620
for the empty glory

702
36:36.860 --> 36:38.940
you and your Li family so desperately crave.

703
36:40.020 --> 36:40.980
Glory or not,

704
36:41.660 --> 36:42.820
wealth or not,

705
36:43.660 --> 36:45.020
haven't you enjoyed them too?

706
36:45.780 --> 36:47.540
I made your mother the Empress.

707
36:47.820 --> 36:49.020
Wasn't that for her own good?

708
36:49.780 --> 36:52.180
I wanted you to marry that young top scholar.

709
36:52.180 --> 36:54.260
Wasn't that for your own good?

710
36:56.460 --> 36:57.380
That's why

711
36:58.260 --> 36:59.420
I'm doing what's best for you now.

712
37:01.740 --> 37:02.180
Uncle,

713
37:03.100 --> 37:04.100
with your limited wits,

714
37:04.940 --> 37:06.340
you're simply not suited to living in Sheng'an,

715
37:06.460 --> 37:07.980
where danger lurks at every turn.

716
37:09.460 --> 37:10.340
Stay too long,

717
37:10.780 --> 37:12.340
and you'll only come to a terrible end.

718
37:15.180 --> 37:16.020
You'd be much better off

719
37:17.780 --> 37:18.900
retiring peacefully in Qiongzhou.

720
37:43.500 --> 37:48.980
(Yes)

721
37:58.860 --> 37:59.180
Sir,

722
38:00.860 --> 38:03.140
there was a matter I didn't have time to report to you

723
38:03.380 --> 38:04.380
before making a decision myself.

724
38:04.660 --> 38:05.700
It's about Li Zhi, isn't it?

725
38:07.500 --> 38:07.940
Yes.

726
38:10.180 --> 38:11.180
I heard...

727
38:12.700 --> 38:14.740
you sent him off to Qiongzhou.

728
38:15.820 --> 38:16.140
Yes.

729
38:17.380 --> 38:18.660
When dealing with clever opponents,

730
38:18.860 --> 38:20.100
you can always anticipate their moves.

731
38:20.620 --> 38:21.260
What's truly dangerous

732
38:21.580 --> 38:23.260
is a fool making reckless moves

733
38:23.740 --> 38:24.780
that defy all reason.

734
38:26.820 --> 38:28.660
Keeping someone like that in Sheng'an

735
38:28.860 --> 38:31.260
could invite all sorts of unforeseen trouble.

736
38:31.780 --> 38:32.420
So...

737
38:33.060 --> 38:33.540
Zidu.

738
38:34.540 --> 38:35.580
No need to explain further.

739
38:36.100 --> 38:37.940
I have complete faith in your judgment.

740
38:39.100 --> 38:39.740
Thank you.

741
38:57.620 --> 38:59.660
So you don't even need to announce yourself anymore?

742
39:00.500 --> 39:01.300
Fang Tong didn't stop me.

743
39:02.420 --> 39:03.340
Why were you out so early?

744
39:04.620 --> 39:05.380
I just went

745
39:05.380 --> 39:07.100
to see your enemy off to Qiongzhou myself.

746
39:07.780 --> 39:09.460
Yan Shang, you owe me a feast for that.

747
39:09.860 --> 39:10.140
Of course.

748
39:10.700 --> 39:13.060
I owe you far more than one feast, Your Highness.

749
39:13.860 --> 39:14.620
Glad you know that.

750
39:23.900 --> 39:24.980
On my way back,

751
39:25.740 --> 39:28.140
I saw some Shence soldiers eating a slaughtered farm ox.

752
39:28.740 --> 39:29.820
They were a disgusting sight.

753
39:30.900 --> 39:32.980
Yu Cheng'an is seizing land outside the city for a hunting ground.

754
39:33.460 --> 39:35.140
It's stirred up a lot of public anger lately.

755
39:35.660 --> 39:36.500
Have you heard about it?

756
39:36.780 --> 39:38.580
He hardly strikes me as someone who enjoys hunting.

757
39:39.740 --> 39:40.580
Why go to such lengths

758
39:40.580 --> 39:42.340
to build a hunting ground?

759
39:43.180 --> 39:43.780
For money?

760
39:44.580 --> 39:45.020
For land?

761
39:45.740 --> 39:46.380
To raise warhorses.

762
39:46.700 --> 39:47.380
To stockpile weapons.

763
39:47.620 --> 39:48.140
Any of those are possible.

764
39:49.260 --> 39:49.740
But

765
39:50.220 --> 39:51.180
if that's the case,

766
39:52.020 --> 39:53.740
he may be digging his own grave.

767
39:55.340 --> 39:57.420
If he has some scheme involving the hunting ground,

768
39:57.900 --> 39:59.380
he'll likely go there himself,

769
40:00.300 --> 40:02.740
leaving his heavily guarded residence and Yintaimen.

770
40:03.140 --> 40:04.420
If he's planning something...

771
40:04.980 --> 40:06.260
The moment he reveals his true intentions

772
40:07.020 --> 40:08.660
will be our chance to catch him off guard.

773
40:15.020 --> 40:15.860
So,

774
40:16.500 --> 40:17.580
what did you actually come here for?

775
40:19.420 --> 40:20.260
I brought something.

776
40:27.380 --> 40:28.820
This lip rouge...

777
40:29.500 --> 40:30.660
Don't tell me it's for me?

778
40:35.740 --> 40:36.540
It's...

779
40:37.460 --> 40:39.020
a gift from Liu Wenji to Chunhua.

780
40:39.900 --> 40:40.540
He asked me to deliver it.

781
40:43.420 --> 40:44.700
She was just here a moment ago.

782
40:45.140 --> 40:46.100
Where did she go?

783
40:48.020 --> 40:48.620
I'll give it to her.

784
40:54.900 --> 40:55.260
Your Highness,

785
40:56.340 --> 40:57.420
Chunhua just received word

786
40:57.620 --> 40:58.900
that her mother had suddenly fallen seriously ill.

787
40:59.300 --> 41:00.180
She rushed home immediately

788
41:00.540 --> 41:01.540
and asked me to request leave on her behalf.

789
41:06.060 --> 41:06.420
Mother!

790
41:07.660 --> 41:08.100
Mother!

791
41:10.620 --> 41:11.340
Chunhua!

792
41:11.700 --> 41:12.100
Chunhua!

793
41:12.300 --> 41:13.060
- Mother. - You're back!

794
41:15.660 --> 41:16.620
Mother, I heard you were ill!

795
41:18.460 --> 41:19.900
Mother just caught a chill.

796
41:20.060 --> 41:20.700
She took some herbal medicine

797
41:20.700 --> 41:21.940
and rested for two days. She's fine now.

798
41:23.180 --> 41:23.820
I'm much better.

799
41:25.740 --> 41:26.020
Come on.

800
41:26.900 --> 41:27.820
Take her luggage inside.

801
41:30.540 --> 41:31.220
You're really all right?

802
41:33.180 --> 41:33.580
Come, sit down.

803
41:38.060 --> 41:38.740
Chunhua,

804
41:40.300 --> 41:41.820
look at you. You're so beautiful.

805
41:46.020 --> 41:47.060
So beautiful.

806
41:47.300 --> 41:47.620
Mother,

807
41:48.620 --> 41:49.500
are you sure you're all right?

808
41:50.500 --> 41:52.140
I brought some more herbs this time.

809
41:52.460 --> 41:53.180
You should try them.

810
41:55.020 --> 41:56.140
I just missed you, dear.

811
41:58.820 --> 41:59.820
All I've ever wanted

812
42:01.420 --> 42:02.260
in this life

813
42:02.420 --> 42:04.180
is to find you a good husband.

814
42:05.140 --> 42:06.700
And now, heaven has answered my prayers

815
42:07.540 --> 42:08.820
and granted my wish.

816
42:10.820 --> 42:11.980
Mother, what are you talking about?

817
42:12.220 --> 42:12.500
I...

818
42:15.540 --> 42:17.180
Chunhua, look at your life now.

819
42:17.740 --> 42:19.740
You may have food and clothing,

820
42:20.020 --> 42:22.340
but you're still just a servant.

821
42:22.980 --> 42:23.460
In this world,

822
42:23.900 --> 42:25.740
no master treats a servant as an equal.

823
42:25.740 --> 42:26.140
Mother.

824
42:26.940 --> 42:28.180
The Princess genuinely cares about me.

825
42:29.220 --> 42:30.540
But you're still a servant.

826
42:32.500 --> 42:33.180
Just imagine.

827
42:34.020 --> 42:36.300
If you could marry into a prince's household,

828
42:37.780 --> 42:39.460
even as a secondary consort...

829
42:39.740 --> 42:40.140
- You... - Wait.

830
42:40.540 --> 42:41.740
Who said I wanted to marry a prince?

831
42:44.260 --> 42:45.060
Mother, what's going on?

832
42:45.140 --> 42:45.580
Nothing.

833
42:46.420 --> 42:49.060
Mother was just asking.

834
42:49.780 --> 42:52.020
Look how worked up Chunhua is.

835
42:53.580 --> 42:53.940
Chunhua,

836
42:54.700 --> 42:55.460
tell me,

837
42:56.620 --> 42:57.180
would you

838
42:57.660 --> 42:59.980
like to become a consort in a prince's household?

839
43:11.180 --> 43:11.980
Forget marrying a prince.

840
43:12.420 --> 43:13.580
I wouldn't marry even the Emperor!

841
43:14.300 --> 43:15.460
I'm perfectly happy serving the Princess.

842
43:15.460 --> 43:16.220
Why should I get married?

843
43:17.860 --> 43:19.380
And if I do, it'll be to someone I love.

844
43:20.900 --> 43:21.860
Silly girl!

845
43:22.100 --> 43:23.820
What good is love?

846
43:23.980 --> 43:24.340
Love...

847
43:24.700 --> 43:26.540
Mother, let me make this clear.

848
43:26.780 --> 43:27.980
I serve the Princess now.

849
43:28.420 --> 43:29.100
Whether I marry or not

850
43:29.180 --> 43:30.300
isn't up to any of you.

851
43:30.740 --> 43:31.980
It's not even up to me!

852
43:34.580 --> 43:35.500
I'm not marrying anyone.

853
43:36.020 --> 43:36.900
I only want to stay by Her Highness's side.

854
43:37.220 --> 43:39.620
Fine. Whatever you say.

855
43:40.140 --> 43:40.900
You're all grown up now.

856
43:40.900 --> 43:42.260
We can't tell you what to do anymore.

857
43:46.900 --> 43:48.060
Chunhua's traveled such a long way.

858
43:48.180 --> 43:48.940
She must be hungry.

859
43:50.540 --> 43:51.020
Well...

860
43:51.700 --> 43:52.740
Let's get you something to eat.

861
43:53.020 --> 43:53.780
Exactly. Chunhua,

862
43:54.700 --> 43:56.140
you were in such a hurry

863
43:56.140 --> 43:57.620
and spent half the day traveling here.

864
43:58.420 --> 43:59.340
You worry about me,

865
43:59.460 --> 44:00.580
and I worry about you too.

866
44:01.420 --> 44:02.580
We made you some sweet soup.

867
44:03.300 --> 44:03.940
Go on, drink it.

868
44:05.260 --> 44:07.220
It'll calm you down and soothe your throat.

869
44:07.220 --> 44:07.780
Thank you.

870
44:19.860 --> 44:24.620
(Next Episode Preview)

871
44:26.940 --> 44:27.860
By Lord Yu's order,

872
44:28.020 --> 44:30.260
the murder suspect must not be taken to the Capital Prefecture!

873
44:30.380 --> 44:32.340
The Yintaimen Investigation Office will handle the case.

874
44:38.020 --> 44:39.860
I want to see Lord Yu...

875
44:41.800 --> 44:45.093
♪Be the ferry where you wait for the sun♪

876
44:47.778 --> 44:52.694
♪Be the blue silk that catches your tears♪

877
44:54.888 --> 45:00.733
♪Be the sleeve we held, worn by dust and years♪

878
45:01.233 --> 45:06.459
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪

879
45:09.228 --> 45:14.019
♪Let me be a captive beast bound by the same lock as you♪

880
45:14.855 --> 45:20.934
♪- Through trails of mud and blood; - let grief drown in your eyes♪

881
45:22.735 --> 45:25.885
♪Soar with the wind; plunge into hellfire as one♪

882
45:25.885 --> 45:27.533
♪Burning bright as a song♪

883
45:27.585 --> 45:31.309
♪See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

884
45:31.687 --> 45:36.353
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪

885
45:36.972 --> 45:41.013
♪If we say forever, then forever it shall be♪

886
45:41.504 --> 45:43.619
♪Not a single hour less♪

887
45:43.659 --> 45:50.605
♪However deep the snow, I'll wait if you're there♪

888
45:51.368 --> 45:54.821
♪We'll be gods above, or wandering souls♪

889
45:55.001 --> 45:58.146
♪In heaven or the underworld, you're all I need♪

890
45:58.585 --> 46:05.222
♪If we can stay, let's return to the village of our first meeting♪

891
46:05.619 --> 46:07.657
♪- May time be free of fear; - boats rock♪

892
46:07.657 --> 46:10.133
♪- May time be free of pain; - lights fade, seasons turn♪

893
46:10.171 --> 46:12.640
♪You're the only one I need♪

894
46:12.844 --> 46:19.731
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain, nothing can break us♪

895
46:20.043 --> 46:23.314
♪Be mine in this world; be mine in this life♪

896
46:23.619 --> 46:26.792
♪My last untouched innocence♪

897
46:27.116 --> 46:30.542
♪If only we could return to the village where we first met♪

898
46:30.775 --> 46:34.000
♪Stay by me; help me forget the frozen dream of last night♪

899
46:34.331 --> 46:41.127
♪Fireflies glow, flowers kiss our lips; just us, through dawn and dusk♪

900
46:41.496 --> 46:43.558
♪- May time be free of fear; - boats rock♪

901
46:43.559 --> 46:46.062
♪- May time be free of pain; - lights fade, seasons turn♪

902
46:46.109 --> 46:48.447
♪You're the only one I need♪

903
46:48.678 --> 46:55.513
♪By your side, through joy and pain, is that eternity?♪

904
46:55.862 --> 46:57.480
♪Till fireworks flood the town♪

905
46:57.610 --> 46:59.406
♪Till the lake is still and clear♪

906
46:59.763 --> 47:02.780
♪You're the only one I need♪

907
47:02.820 --> 47:04.147
(No animals were harmed or mistreated in production.)
